          "text": "Right upper quadrant and epigastric pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent colicky, gripping pain radiating to the right scapula; reported as up to 8/10 and now 2–3/10. Possible association with fatty meals, takeaway, or coffee. Duration is uncertain; patient alternately described weeks and months."
      }
    },
